Package: kimi-code-arm64
Version: 2.0.14
Section: devel
Priority: optional
Architecture: arm64
Maintainer: Kimi Code ARM64 Packager <localhost>
Depends: python3 (>= 3.8), python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-3.0, gnome-screenshot, bash, curl, ca-certificates
Suggests: google-chrome-stable | chromium
Description: ARM64 desktop integration for Kimi Code
 Launches Kimi Code CLI and opens its web interface in a Chrome app window.
 The CLI is installed online from the official source when first needed.
 Provides background installation, update detection, one-click upgrades,
 persistent sessions, and graceful shutdown.
